(1. Working of the Project \(In Simple Terms\)) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
14 TL
0 -18 Td
(The Job Alert Platform is an automated email notification system built to connect students with) '
(verified IT career opportunities. It automates the collection of student subscriptions, cloud secret) '
(synchronization, job listing extraction, HTML email compilation, and automated daily dispatch.) '
ET

0.96 0.94 1.0 rg
0.8 0.7 0.95 RG
40 600 515 90 re f S

BT
0.4 0.1 0.7 rg
/F2 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 52 672 Tm
(Real-World Analogy: How the System Works) Tj
0.2 0.2 0.2 rg
/F1 9 Tf
13 TL
0 -16 Td
(1. Admin Portal: System admins register student subscribers through a Flask web application.) '
(2. Cloud Secret Vault: Student lists are encrypted with PyNaCl and pushed to GitHub Secrets.) '
(3. Automated Mailer Engine: Reads jobs from jobs.json, picks 20 random openings + career quote,) '
(   formats responsive HTML cards, and emails each student via Gmail SMTP.) '
ET

BT
0 0 0 rg
/F2 13 Tf
1 0 0 1 40 565 Tm
(2. Key Models Used in the System) Tj

/F2 10.5 Tf
0 -20 Td
(A. User Authentication Data Model \(SQLite: users table\)) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(Stores admin credentials: id, username, password \(Bcrypt hash\), role \(admin/user\), email.) '
(Enforces Role-Based Access Control so only authorized admins can add/delete students.) '

/F2 10.5 Tf
0 -28 Td
(B. Student Subscriber Data Model \(SQLite: students table\)) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(Stores recipient directory: id, name, email \(UNIQUE constraint\), created_at timestamp.) '
(Calculates enrollment duration in days. Uses UPSERT logic on duplicate email submission.) '

/F2 10.5 Tf
0 -28 Td
(C. Job Opportunity Data Model \(jobs.json\)) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(Datastore of scraped IT job listings with title \(e.g., AI Engineer, Data Science Intern\) and link.) '
(Links are sanitized in mailer.py to guarantee valid HTTPS application URLs.) '

/F2 10.5 Tf
0 -28 Td
(D. Career Quote Data Model \(career_quotes_unique.xlsx\)) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(Indexed Excel dataset of motivational career quotes parsed by pandas for daily email rotation.) '
ET
