(E. Sodium SealedBox Cryptographic Security Model \(PyNaCl\)) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(Asymmetric Curve25519 + XSalsa20 + Poly1305 public-key encryption model. When students) '
(are added/deleted, sync_student_secrets\(\) encrypts name and email payloads using GitHub's) '
(public key before updating GitHub Repository Secrets via REST API.) '

/F2 10.5 Tf
0 -32 Td
(F. Bcrypt Hashing & Timed Serializer Security Models) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(1. Bcrypt Hashing: Salted blowfish cipher hashing for user passwords.) '
(2. URLSafeTimedSerializer: Signed HMAC SHA-1 tokens with 1-hour expiration for password reset.) '

/F2 13 Tf
0 -35 Td
(3. Step-by-Step Output Pipeline \(Data Flow\)) Tj

/F2 10.5 Tf
0 -22 Td
(Step 1: Student Registration & Cloud Encryption Sync) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(Admin logs into Flask portal -> Submits student details -> Saved to SQLite users.db ->) '
(sync_student_secrets\(\) encrypts list with GitHub Public Key -> Pushes to GitHub Secrets API.) '

/F2 10.5 Tf
0 -28 Td
(Step 2: Recipient Data & Content Ingestion) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(mailer.py executes -> Reads EMAIL_TO and STUDENT_NAMES from environment secrets \(or local DB\) ->) '
(Loads jobs.json repository -> Parses career_quotes_unique.xlsx via pandas.) '

/F2 10.5 Tf
0 -28 Td
(Step 3: Dynamic Job Sampling & URL Sanitization) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(mailer.py calls random.sample\(jobs, min\(20, len\(jobs\)\)\) to select 20 fresh job openings ->) '
(Fixes malformed URLs to ensure clean application links.) '

/F2 10.5 Tf
0 -28 Td
(Step 4: Responsive HTML Email Newsletter Rendering) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(Generates styled HTML card layout with purple 'View & Apply' buttons -> Replaces {USER_NAME}) '
(placeholder dynamically for each student recipient.) '

/F2 10.5 Tf
0 -28 Td
(Step 5: Secure SMTP Dispatch & Output Delivery) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
13 TL
0 -14 Td
(Connects to Gmail SMTP \(smtp.gmail.com:587\) using STARTTLS -> Authenticates with credentials ->) '
(Sends individual MIME HTML emails straight to each student's Gmail inbox.) '
ET
endstream
